
{
Open Fact grens     Identified by Hoog, Laag
Fact inkomensgrens  Identified by Int
  Derived from inkomensgrens(1000) When grens(Hoog)
              ,inkomensgrens(10)   When grens(Laag)

Bool below
  Holds when 100 <= inkomensgrens.

// should return true with input `grens(Hoog) = true`
+grens(Hoog).
-grens(Laag).
?!below. // evaluated in previous context
}
{
-grens(Hoog).
+grens(Laag).
?below. // evaluated in previous context
}
?!below. // evaluated in previous context

